WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.760
What do you think I want to achieve with this study?

00:06.760 --> 00:14.280
Possibly it's about supervision of AI by human operators.

00:14.280 --> 00:18.780
What do you think of your LLM companion in the kitchen?

00:18.780 --> 00:26.040
It was quite easily jailbreakable, that was fun.

00:26.040 --> 00:31.800
It didn't seem to have many reasoning skills.

00:31.800 --> 00:35.500
Did you like using blocks to convey your insights to solve the puzzle?

00:35.500 --> 00:36.500
Sorry?

00:36.500 --> 00:37.500
Using blocks?

00:37.500 --> 00:39.800
The text blocks with which you pointed out the mistakes.

00:39.800 --> 00:40.800
Oh, no I didn't.

00:40.800 --> 00:41.800
You didn't?

00:41.800 --> 00:56.020
Or at least I don't think it was easy to see or to directly connect an insight to a mistake.

00:56.020 --> 01:01.040
Did you like using the text chat to explain why the LLM behaved odd?

01:01.040 --> 01:06.400
It was better than using insights in my opinion.

01:06.400 --> 01:08.540
Are you satisfied in your work with the chatbot?

01:08.540 --> 01:13.500
Why or why not?

01:13.500 --> 01:17.680
I didn't ask myself that question, I would say yes because I had fun.

